{"title":"Career Roadmap · Pharma Executive","role":"Pharma Executive","summary":"A Pharma Executive is a broad pharmaceutical-industry role that may involve product coordination, scientific communication, sales, marketing, business development, regulatory support, product operations or customer engagement.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc (Bachelor of Science - General / Honours)","Course":"Biochemistry"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Pharma Executive is a broad pharmaceutical-industry role that may involve product coordination, scientific communication, sales, marketing, business development, regulatory support, product operations or customer engagement."},{"type":"p","text":"For a B.Sc Biochemistry graduate, relevant pathways include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pharmaceutical sales"},{"text":"Medical/scientific sales"},{"text":"Product management"},{"text":"Business development"},{"text":"Pharmaceutical marketing"},{"text":"Product support"},{"text":"Regulatory coordination"},{"text":"Clinical research support"},{"text":"Quality and compliance"},{"text":"Medical information"},{"text":"Pharmaceutical operations"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The exact responsibilities vary considerably by company. A student targeting this career should combine biochemistry knowledge with pharmaceutical industry knowledge and commercial/business skills."},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Biochemistry","Pharmacology","Pharmaceutical Products","Medical Communication","Sales/Marketing","Data Analysis","Regulatory Awareness"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Career Flow"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc Biochemistry","Biochemistry + Human Biology","Pharmacology + Drug Development Fundamentals","Pharmaceutical Industry Knowledge","Product Knowledge + Medical Communication","Sales / Marketing / Regulatory / Clinical Specializati