tory review"},{"text":"Pharmacovigilance"},{"text":"Post-marketing surveillance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Pharmaceutical Marketing"},{"type":"p","text":"For a commercial Pharma Executive role, develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Market research"},{"text":"Competitor analysis"},{"text":"Product positioning"},{"text":"Customer segmentation"},{"text":"Brand strategy"},{"text":"Product lifecycle"},{"text":"Pricing concepts"},{"text":"Sales forecasting"},{"text":"Market trends"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the difference between:"},{"type":"p","text":"Scientific product information and promotional claims."},{"type":"p","text":"Pharmaceutical communication must follow applicable laws, company procedures and ethical requirements."},{"type":"h","text":"Medical Communication"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop the ability to communicate scientific information to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Doctors"},{"text":"Pharmacists"},{"text":"Hospitals"},{"text":"Laboratories"},{"text":"Distributors"},{"text":"Internal sales teams"},{"text":"Business stakeholders"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to explain:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mechanism of action"},{"text":"Product benefits"},{"text":"Clinical evidence"},{"text":"Safety information"},{"text":"Product differentiation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Avoid unsupported medical claims."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Sales & Business Skills"},{"type":"h","text":"Pharmaceutical Sales"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Territory management"},{"text":"Customer mapping"},{"text":"Lead generation"},{"text":"Sales planning"},{"text":"Customer relationship management"},{"text":"Sales reporting"},{"text":"Product presentations"},{"text":"Objection handling"},{"text":"Business communication"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the commercial workflow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Market Research","Target Customer Identification","Product Positioning","Customer Engagement","Product Communication","Order / Busin